---
id: pages
course: test
title: Going back to a page
cover: optional
source: A short test of wiping the board and bringing a page back. Not a lesson.
---
title: First page
say: This is the first page.
write a: a = 1
title: Second page
say: Now the board is wiped, and this is a second page.
write b: b = 2
say: Let's go back to the first page.
page: First page
say: Here it is again, and I can add to it without writing it out again.
write c: c = a + 1
say: And now back to the second page.
page: Second page
say: That is the end of the test.
